            }
        }
        stage('Deploy to Dev') {
            when {
                branch 'develop'
            }
            steps {
                // Deploy to development environment
            }
        }
        stage('Deploy to Staging') {
            when {
                branch 'release-*'
            }
            steps {
                // Deploy to staging environment
            }
        }
        stage('Deploy to Production') {
            when {
                branch 'master'
            }
            steps {
                // Deploy to production environment
            }
        }
    }
    post {
        always {
            // Clean up, notifications, etc.
        }
        failure {
            // Rollback if necessary
        }
    }
}
```

**Trade-offs:**
- **Cost vs. Performance:** More resources can improve performance but increase costs. Choose the right balance for your needs.
- **Operational Complexity:** More automated processes can reduce complexity but require initial setup and maintenance effort.

Remember to always follow best practices for security, such as using secret management tools for sensitive data, implementing least privilege access controls, and regularly auditing your pipeline for vulnerabilities.

